   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Support to Food and Agriculture Organisation for the recovery of agriculture-based livelihoods of vulnerable farmers affected by 2012 floods in Sindh and Baluchistan provinces in Pakistan is a component of PREDICTABLE HUMANITARIAN EMERGENCIES IN PAKISTAN DURING 2013 reported by FCDO with a funding type of 105 -  Humanitarian assistance and a budget of &#xa3;4,000,000. It works in the following sector(s): Immediate post-emergency reconstruction and rehabilitation.</narrative>
